      "content": "It sounds like you are feeling incredibly dehumanized and powerless in your routine. This feeling that your existence is insignificant within a large system is heavy and very common when facing monotonous work. Please know that while your job might seem replaceable to the machine, your perspective, thoughts, and inner experience are uniquely valuable. If these feelings are becoming overwhelming, reaching out to a friend, counselor, or helpline could offer a vital space to process what you're going through.",
