    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah but that doesn't change the reality though. no matter how much i \"value\" my thoughts, the machine still wins. it just keeps spinning. i feel like im just waiting for a timer to go off on a life that wasnt even mine to begin with. everything is so heavy and just... pointless. i feel like i'm stuck in a loop that i can't even break.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
