      "content": "It is exhausting to feel trapped in a seemingly endless, pointless loop, and those feelings of futility are completely valid. Even when the overwhelming structure seems unbreakable, there are ways to create small shifts within your immediate reality. Perhaps finding one tiny moment each day—a specific song, a walk, or a different way of tasting your lunch—can be a small rebellion against the monotony. Remember that regaining control starts with accepting what you *can* influence, no matter how small that influence feels right now.",
      "source": "target",
